# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) to trace devnet transactions through Triton One.
#
# The dev server (and `vite preview`) forwards /triton/devnet to this URL on the server side, token and all,
# so the browser never holds it. There is deliberately no VITE_ prefix: Vite would copy a VITE_ variable
# into the page. Without it the trace card reads devnet through the public devnet RPC instead.
TRITON_DEVNET_RPC_URL=https://<your-endpoint>.devnet.rpcpool.com/<x-token>

# Optional: the keypair that is the mint authority of the devnet pools' tokens (path from the repository root). It turns on the
# "Get test tokens" button and `npm --workspace apps/fair-launch-ui run fund`, which mint 100 of a pool's tokens into a wallet.
# The dev server holds the key and only answers this machine; the browser never sees it. A local validator needs nothing.
# FAUCET_KEYPAIR=.keys/deployer.json
